     "page_type": "homepage",
     "text": "Baina Cashmere. Baina Cashmere: From raw fibers to exquisite garments, your trusted partner. We are a highly vertically integrated company specializing in the research, development, and production of premium cashmere. Our operations cover the entire process — from raw materials and yarns to finished garments. With deep industry experience and a strong commitment to quality, consistency, and efficiency, we strive to be a global leader in the cashmere industry. Our headquarters is located in Qinghe County, Xingtai City, Hebei Province — known as the \"Cashmere Textile Capital of China.\" We operate four modern production facilities in Qinghe, Hebei and Erenhot, Inner Mongolia. Our annual production capacity includes 350 tons of dehaired cashmere, 300 tons of cashmere yarn, and over 1.2 million pieces of finished cashmere garments. With a team of over 400 skilled employees, all of our lead technicians have more than 30 years of experience, ensuring that every product meets the highest standards of craftsmanship and quality. Baina Cashmere has established branches in South Korea and the United States, and we continue to optimize and innovate our vertically integrated operations. We are committed to delivering exceptional cashmere products that meet our clients’ high expectations for quality, scalability, and consistency. By cutting out middlemen, we offer better value and more personalized service. With 20+ years of experience in international trade via Tianjin Port, we ensure fast, safe, and on-time global delivery. Service. One. Garment Partnership. OEM. You provide the designs; we handle production and apply your brand label. If needed, we offer design consultation services. ODM. We provide original designs; you select and brand them as your own. Wholesale. Sell our branded collections directly, ideal for boutiques, e-commerce platforms, and other retail channels. Service. Two. Cashmere Yarn Supply. We supply premium-grade cashmere yarn tailored for upscale brands and large-scale manufacturing. Our yarn is engineered for consistency, softness, and performance — ideal for knitwear collections, woven garments, and luxury textile production. Offered in a wide range of counts and colors, with custom dyeing available to meet your design and production needs. Service. Three. Design Consulting. We have an experienced design team based in New York ready to provide professional guidance and assist with product development, style design, and sampling. Subscribe for the latest on product availability, pricing updates, and business opportunities. Thank you! Your submission has been received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Contact. Email. info@bainacashmereusa.com. Phone. xxx-xxx-xxxx. WhatsApp. Company. Dehairing Facility Spinning Facility Knitwear Facility Showroom Korean Joint Venture Tianjin Trading Company US Trading Company Ranch. About. History of Baina Sustainability Letter. Materials. Color Card Frabric Cashmere Yarn. OEM ODM Wholesale FAQ Contact Us. © 2025 Baina. All rights reserved.",
