     "page_type": "about",
     "text": "New York Trading Company. Baina Cashmere USA bridges the richness of Chinese craftsmanship with the creativity of New York. We focus on four core areas. Rooted in the vibrant energy of the city, our local team stays closely attuned to market trends while building lasting connections within the design and retail communities. Backed by China’s robust and vertically integrated supply chain, we bring world-class cashmere to North American clients with speed, flexibility, and uncompromising quality. Brand Partnerships: Expanding in North America through collaborations with boutique retailers, department stores, and online platforms. Original New York Design: Our local design team offers expert consulting to help brands and retailers develop exclusive cashmere collections tailored to their markets. OEM & ODM: From small-batch development to large-scale production, we provide flexible OEM/ODM solutions that meet the highest standards. Localized Operations: With streamlined logistics and responsive service, we optimize timelines and elevate the customer experience across the U.S. At Baina Cashmere, quality comes first. We hand-select the world’s finest fibers and pair them with thoughtful design and modern techniques to create timeless, functional luxury. Our mission is to grow with like-minded partners — championing the beauty of cashmere and advancing a more sustainable future for fashion. Address. 433 Broadway, New York, NY 10013. Subscribe for the latest on product availability, pricing updates, and business opportunities. Thank you! Your submission has been received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Contact. Email. info@bainacashmereusa.com. Phone. xxx-xxx-xxxx. WhatsApp. Company. Dehairing Facility Spinning Facility Knitwear Facility Showroom Korean Joint Venture Tianjin Trading Company US Trading Company Ranch. About. History of Baina Sustainability Letter. Materials. Color Card Frabric Cashmere Yarn. OEM ODM Wholesale FAQ Contact U