     "text": "HOME - Roedeo Cashmere. Skip to content. WhatsApp：+86 16602239659. Email：info@roedeocashmere.com. Linkedin. Youtube. SEND REQUESTS. We are committed to collecting, producing and providing the world's finest cashmere fiber. A professional cashmere sourcing team has been looking for the top-quality raw materials in Inner Mongolia for decades. Dehaired Goats Wool. Learn More. Cashmere Yarns. Learn More. Garments & Accessories. Learn More. The high quality of Roedeo Cashmere comes from strict origin control, selecting from nine production areas with the best quality of raw cashmere. On March 1998, we came to a beautiful port with passion and love. Then we started our trade journey for more than 20 years. We love and appreciate this gift from nature —— CASHMERE. We are pleased and proud to deliver our cashmere to the world. My dear future customer, let us feel this warmth from nature together.",
