     "text": "ABOUT - Roedeo Cashmere. Skip to content. WhatsApp：+86 16602239659. Email：info@roedeocashmere.com. Linkedin. Youtube. SEND REQUESTS. COMPANY OVERVIEW. Tianjin Port Free Trade Roedeo International Trade CO., LTD was established in 1998 which specialized in dehaired cashmere and finished cashmere products. Roedeo Cashmere is the brand that registered after the company’s establishment. The brand’s product line includes dehaired cashmere, cashmere yarns, and finished products. FACTORY OVERVIEW. Our dehairing factory is located in Qinghe county, Hebei province, China. Qinghe county is known as “the city of cashmere”. Our company is specialized in collecting the world’s finest cashmere that originated in Alashan area, Inner-Mongolia. This area produces the finest cashmere fiber within 15.3um in China due to the unique climate and geographic position. The finishing product factory is located in Linhe, Inner-Monogolia, China. Our company has a matured management to regulate all the processing step for finishing products such as clothing and scarf by using our unique dehaired cashmere. SFA CERTIFIED FACTORY. As an SFA-certified manufacturing facility, we specialize in cashmere production with complete raw material traceability. A full-range industrial chain runs through our entire production process, providing comprehensive guarantees for our products. We adhere to strict quality control and transparent source management, so you can always rest assured about the quality and origin of our cashmere goods. We can offer you the right kind of fibre at your specifications at the time you need it. Let's begin our long-term partnership. Contact Us Now.",
