     "page_type": "homepage",
     "text": "Clean Cashmere | American Cashmere. top of page. CLEAN CASHMERE. View Now. NEW RELEASE. LOOKBOOK 2027 PATTERNS NOW AVAILABLE. 12 patterns meticulously test knitted with our 4 yarn lines to make sure that they come out perfect for you! We are growing the American cashmere industry,. one farm at a time. SHOP OUR YARN BLENDS. 100% Cashmere. Light Fingering. SHOP PURE. 50% Cashmere/ 50% Merino. Sport Weight. SHOP PRIME. 60% Cormo/ 40% Cashmere. Sock Weight. SHOP AMERICANA. 70% Shaniko/ 30% Cashmere. DK Weight. SHOP DREAM. All Categories. Shop All. SORT BY COLOR. AMERICANA - Petal Pink. Price $20.00. PRIME - Rose. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Raspberry. Price $20.00. PURE - Brick Red. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Daylily. Price $20.00. AMERICANA - Buttercup. Price $20.00. PURE - Dirty Martini. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Light Olive. Price $20.00. AMERICANA - Forest. Price $20.00. PURE - Woodland. Price $60.00. PURE - Aqua. Price $60.00. PURE - Ocean. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Cyan. Price $20.00. DREAM - Morning Glory. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Cornflower. Price $20.00. DREAM - Indigo. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Blue Jean. Price $60.00. PURE - Twilight Blue. Price $60.00. DREAM - Lilac. Price $60.00. PRIME - Lavender. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Hydrangea. Price $60.00. PURE - CC Color. Price $60.00. PURE - Burgundy. Price $60.00. PURE - Natural Taupe. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Bark. Price $20.00. PURE - Natural White. Price $60.00. AMERICANA - Natural White. Price $35.00. Our Newest Herd Members! Explore Our Herd's Farms. 1-50 Goats. Opuntia Ranch. Trinidad, CO. Read More. Dagni. 1-50 Goats. Aisling Farm. Greenfield Center, NY. Read More. Cody & Kateri Sargen. Clean Cashmere Quarterly Club. Price $110.00. PERFECT PATTERNS FOR OUR PURE YARN. These patterns have been hand selected by our top knitters to work perfectly with our PURE yarn. 1 Skein. Secret Garden Bandana. by Gabrielle Augustine ​. Color Used: Ocean. Size Made: One Size. Needles Used: US 4 / 3.5mm. View More. 2 Skeins. Cloudburst Mitts. by Adrienne Grey. Color Used: Brick Red. Size Made: One Size. Needles Used: US 2.5 / 3.0mm. View More. 3+ Skeins. Mae Flower Shawl. by Jessica Weindl. Color Used: CC Color. Size Made: One Size. Needles Used: US 4 / 3.5mm. View More. View More Patterns. available now. GIFT CARDS. SHOP HERE. American Cashmere. We partner with small family farms across the U.S. to provide you with the most luxurious American cashmere. LEARN MORE. Ethical Cashmere. Our farms use the North American Cashmere Standard as their herd breed standard. LEARN MORE. Timeless Cashmere. We create exceptional American cashmere products that will be treasured for generations. LEARN MORE. bottom of page.",
