Coat Factory. >. Sustainability ▾. Sustainability. Responsible materials, thoughtful manufacturing, and long-term value. Sustainable Fibres. >. Premium Cashmere & Wool Fabrics. >. Responsible Workplace. >. Certifications. >. Insights ▾. Insights. Insights on industry trends, exhibitions, materials, manufacturing, and cashmere care. Trends & Exhibitions. >. Material Knowledge. >. Knit Manufacturing Insights. >. Woven Manufacturing Insights. >. Cashmere Care. >. Contact. Menu. Richman Cashmere. Cashmere Knitwear & Outerwear Manufacturer | Cashmere Expertise Since 2005. Explore Our Manufacturing. Discuss Your Collection. Your Cashmere Manufacturing Partner. About Richman. Founded in 2005, Richman has grown from an international trading company into an integrated natural fibre manufacturer, supported by our knitwear production base in Inner Mongolia and long-term outerwear manufacturing partners. We support luxury global fashion brands from material selection and product development to sampling, bulk production, inspection, and delivery — with a focus on premium cashmere, refined craftsmanship, and consistent production support. More about us →. 21+ Years. Cashmere Trade & Production Experience. 18+ Specialists. Merchandising & Production Follow-up Team. Quality First. Integrity In Every Order. NATURAL FIBRE SELECTION. Our Finest Fibres. Premium natural fibres — including cashmere, fine merino wool, alpaca, yak, camel, cotton, silk, linen, and refined blends — are carefully selected for their purity, softness, texture, and enduring performance. From luxuriously soft cashmere knitwear to structured cashmere outerwear, material selection is guided by more than fibre composition alone. Our team works closely with brand owners, designers, and product development teams to evaluate yarns and fabrics through handfeel, drape, seasonal colour direction, price positioning, production suitability, and the overall vision of each collection. Explore Material Library. Richman. Precision In Every Detail. Our Craftsmanship. Craftsmanship at Richman is built on experience, precision, and respect for natural fibres. Every yarn, stitch, seam, and finish is carefully reviewed to ensure balanced handfeel, accurate fit, clean appearance, and long-lasting quality. From knitwear gauge consistency, pilling resistance, dimensional stability, construction integrity to double-faced coat cutting, hand-sewing, precise stitching, edge finishing and garment structure, our teams manage each detail with discipline and care — helping premium brands create refined products that feel as good as they look. Sweaters. Gauge · Linking · Finishing. Coats. Cutting · Hand-finishing · Ironing. Explore Our QUALITY CONTROL PROCESS. Complete project support. Our Development Support. We support brands from initial concept to final delivery through yarn recommendation, swatch development, technical sampling, fitting adjustment, material sourcing, and bulk production coordination. Our merchandising and technical teams help clients select suitable fibres, yarns, gauges, techniques, colours, trims, and finishing methods according to season, target price, market positioning, and collection direction. SEND US YOUR TECHPACK. 01. Design Brief. 02. Yarn & Material Suggestion. 03. Swatch Development. 04. Sample Making. 05. Fit & Technique Adjustment. 06. Bulk Production. 07. Inspection & Delivery. 08. Customer Support. OUR PRODUCT CAPABILITIES. Our Products. From premium knitwear and tailored outerwear to accessories and novelty yarn knitwear development, Richman supports diverse cashmere collections with broad product capabilities, strong technical development experience, and a growing library of sustainable material development. Knitwear. Women, Men, Baby & Kids, Fine Gauge Styles. EXPLORE →. Outerwear. Double-faced, Single-faced Coats, Trench Coats, Jackets, Blazers. EXPLORE →. Fancy Yarn Knitwear. Cashmere, Wool, Alpaca, Yak & Camel Blend, Silk. EXPLORE →. Home & Lifestyle. Blankets, Throws, Socks, Travel Sets, Pet Cashmere. EXPLORE →. Accessories. Scarves, Beanies, Gloves, Fur Trim, Seasonal accessories. EXPLORE →. Discover Our Facilities. Our Manufacturing Overview. Richman helps brands develop and manufacture premium natural fibre collections with stronger material support, reliable production capacity, experienced merchandising, and long-term quality consistency. Discover Cashmere Knitwear Manufacturing. Engineered for gauge consistency, pilling resistance, dimensional stability, and construction integrity—. Learn More ›. Discover Woven Outerwear Manufacturing. Specialized in refined woven garment making, with precise layer cutting, hand stitching, controlled stitch density—. Learn More ›. Respect for people, nature, and the future. Our Sustainability. At Richman, sustainability is part of the way we work. We care about the responsible materials, thoughtful manufacturing, and long-term value for natural fibre collections. We partner with shared-value suppliers who uphold environmental ethics and responsible production. With strict standards and certified practices, we craft refined, reliable cashmere—made with respect for people, nature, and tomorrow. Responsible Materials. Certified Production. Long-term Value. Discover Sustainable Practices →. Our Philosophy. Tailored Solutions for Every Brand Journey. At Richman, we believe every brand has its own position, pace, and vision. Our role is to understand where each client stands, what they need now, and where they want to grow next. From material selection and product development to sampling, production, quality control, and final delivery, we provide integrated product and service solutions tailored to different brand stages, market levels, and collection requirements. Partner With Richman →. Ready To Develop Your Next Collection? Share your design direction, material preference, tech pack, or reference sample with our team. Discuss Your Collection →. Email. WhatsApp. Contact Form. cashmere@