ctory. >. Woven Coat Factory. >. Sustainability ▾. Sustainability. Responsible materials, thoughtful manufacturing, and long-term value. Sustainable Fibres. >. Premium Cashmere & Wool Fabrics. >. Responsible Workplace. >. Certifications. >. Insights ▾. Insights. Insights on industry trends, exhibitions, materials, manufacturing, and cashmere care. Trends & Exhibitions. >. Material Knowledge. >. Knit Manufacturing Insights. >. Woven Manufacturing Insights. >. Cashmere Care. >. Contact. Menu. Spinning Factory. Yarn Development & Spinning Support — from refined fibre preparation to. premium yarn for knitwear and outerwear collections. Home. >>. Spinning Factory. Our Yarn Capability. Spinning Yarn & Yarn Development Support. From Fibre to Refined Yarn. Richman works closely with one of the world’s leading cashmere producers — an important participant in premium cashmere standards and a trusted name in high-quality raw cashmere. With exclusive access to exceptional white cashmere origins, advanced dehairing and processing technology, and an annual output capacity of up to 2,500 tons, our partner provides a strong foundation for stable and high-quality cashmere supply. Through this long-term and reliable partnership, we are able to support large-volume orders with greater confidence, flexibility, and consistency. This integrated supply advantage allows us to offer brands a more secure, efficient, and refined cashmere solution — from raw fibre selection to finished garment production. Traceable Cashmere Sources. Selected upstream cashmere resources and traceability support help meet customized raw fibre quality needs. Colour & Yarn Development. Strong colour development capabilities deliver stable premium cashmere yarns. Improved Price Stability. Long-term raw cashmere partnership helps improve price stability during market fluctuations. Faster Delivery. Faster delivery lead times support seasonal programs and repeat orders. 01. Fibre Preparation. Fibres are combed and prepared for stable spinning quality. 02. Blending & Spinning. Controlled processing supports yarn structure, handfeel, and consistency. 03. Production Control. Organized spinning lines help maintain stable quality and supply. 04. Cone Yarn Supply. Finished cones are ready for sampling, knitting, and bulk production. Yarn Supply Advantage. Stable Yarn Support For Seasonal Collections. A reliable yarn supply foundation helps brands reduce development uncertainty, improve colour planning, and move more smoothly from sampling to bulk production. Richman works with selected yarn partners to support stable cashmere and natural fibre yarn options for different collection needs. Stable Premium Yarn Resources. Long-term yarn partners support consistent quality and reliable supply. Colour & Custom Development. Support for seasonal colour development, custom blends, yarn counts, and handfeel direction. Faster Sampling Coordination. Coordinated sourcing and yarn development help improve sampling efficiency and delivery planning. Quality Focus in Yarn Development. Yarn quality affects every stage of the final product — from knitting performance and handfeel to colour appearance and garment consistency. Our development process pays close attention to fibre selection, blend balance, yarn regularity, colour consistency, and suitability for the intended gauge and product category. Discuss Yarn Development Options. Share your yarn requirements, target price, certification needs, or collection direction with our team. We can help evaluate suitable yarn and fibre options for your project. Explore Our Knitwear Production → Discuss Your Collection →. cashmere@richmancashmere.com. +1 347 956 6988. We use cookies. We use cookies to improve your experience and analyze site traffic. Choose which cookies you allow. Necessary. Required for the website to function. Cannot be disabled. Analytics. Help us understand how visitors interact with the website. No analytics cookies are used on this site.