artnership. Jointly operated knitwear factory in Hebei. 2023. Own Production Base. Inner Mongolia Richman Cashmere Co Ltd - Manufacturing established. Our Material Selection. Natural Fibres We Work With. We work with carefully selected natural fibres and refined blends to support product development, seasonal collections, and long-term manufacturing for global fashion brands. Cashmere. Merino Wool. Camel Hair. Yak. Alpaca. Mohair. Silk. Cotton. Linen. Selected Blends. About Richman. Built On Service, Craftsmanship, And Responsibility. Every fashion brand has different development needs, target prices, and production priorities. Richman works closely with clients to understand their product direction, recommend suitable yarns and fabrics, and provide practical advice on construction, sampling, and manufacturing feasibility. From initial concepts and technical development to production coordination and final inspection, our team maintains clear communication and consistent follow-up, helping brands make informed decisions throughout the process. Product Development. Yarn and fabric material recommendations, construction advice, swatch and sample development tailored to each collection. Production Follow-up. Clear communication, production planning, and progress follow-up from sampling through bulk manufacturing. Quality Responsibility. Attention to workmanship, dimensional stability, finishing, and inspection throughout production. What We Pursue. At Richman, we believe lasting partnerships are built on trust, transparency, and shared commitment to quality. We value honest communication, responsible sourcing, and consistent workmanship, working closely with our clients to develop products that reflect their brand identity and long-term expectations. Our goal is not simply to manufacture garments, but to be a dependable partner in every collection we help bring to life. Partner With Richman. Share your design direction, material preference, or reference sample with our