     "page_type": "products",
     "text": "Cashmerefine production to Biella - PRODUCTION ITALY. Skip to content. Italy. HOME | PRODUCTION | ITALY. In 2025, Cashmerefine returned to Biella, in the heart of Italian historic textile district, to establish “La Bottega del Cashmere” — a state-of-the-art production site where excellence in the creation of tops and high-quality knitwear comes to life. This investment strengthens the Company’s presence in Italy while reaffirming its commitment to innovation and artisanal savoir-faire. Biella. Italy once again stands at the center of Cashmerefine’s vision, not only as the home of production excellence but also as a symbol of the Company’s unmistakably Italian style and taste. “La Bottega del Cashmere” is more than a production site: it is a true laboratory of style, where tradition and modernity converge to create garments that embody Italian identity, elegance, and timeless craftsmanship. ABOUT US. World leader in the private label knitwear production. in cashmere and precious yarns for brands and retailers. Privacy Policy – Cookie Policy. CASHMEREFINE SA. Home. Facilities. Verticality. Yarns. Style development. Stock service. Contact. CONTATTI. Via Moree, 16. CH 6850 – Mendrisio. Switzerland. info@cashmerefine.ch. +41 091 64 74 040. Instagram. LinkedIn. English. Italian. English. Caricamento commenti...",
