     "page_type": "about",
     "text": "Sustainable company. 0. Sustainable company. Premium-quality recycled eco-cashmere. The future of cashmere is circular. Our regenerated cashmere garments are born from a simple yet profound belief: true sustainability does not mean giving up beauty, but transforming what already exists into something new, without compromising on quality. Recycled cashmere: a new idea of luxury. Regenerated cashmere is the heart of our philosophy. We recover cashmere sweaters and offcuts, select them carefully and transform them into a new, precious fibre. This regenerated material gives rise to our Raw Cashmere yarn, the basis of sustainable knitwear made with full respect for the environment and for people. This process allows us to reduce our environmental impact, limiting the use of water, energy and chemicals. The result is a fine recycled eco-cashmere, offering the same softness and durability as traditional cashmere, but with an infinitely lighter ecological footprint. The production of our knitwear wholesale business is based on the principles of the circular economy: 01 Reduce waste. 02 Limit CO₂ emissions. 03 Reuse resources. 04 Regenerate materials. Every stage of the process, from the collection of used garments to spinning, is part of a virtuous cycle that enhances what already exists. In this way, regenerated cashmere becomes a symbol of sustainable innovation: a precious material that lives on, season after season. Our cashmere knitwear production takes place between Montemurlo and the Tuscan textile districts, in collaboration with Italian partners who share our values: a short, traceable supply chain that allows us to guarantee control, quality and real sustainability. Every sweater, pullover or scarf in cashmere, every yarn, tells the story of an ethical and conscious Made in Italy, built over time and with passion, and looking to the future. A luxury product, crafted and natural, that respects the planet and creates value. Our products. Raw Cashmere clothing Discover Raw Cashmere yarns Discover Vintage clothing box Discover.",
