     "url": "https://icubenest.com/",
     "page_type": "homepage",
     "text": "Home – Full-chain cashmere and fine knitwear OEM/ODM manufacturing. Skip to content. iCubeNest. OEM/ODM Knitwear Manufacturing. Integrated Cashmere Manufacturer from Fiber to Finished Garments. Anhui Tianwei Cashmere Products Co., Ltd. From cashmere fiber processing and spinning to knitting, dyeing and finished garments, we provide integrated manufacturing solutions for global fashion brands, wholesalers and textile companies. Request a Quote. View Capabilities. Established. 1980. Factory Area（Acres）. 0. +. Employees. 0. +. Patents. 0. +. ISO 9001、WRAP、BSCI audited company. FROM FIBER TO FASHION. Integrated Cashmere Manufacturing. An integrated production chain covering cashmere processing, spinning, knitting and finished garments. Fiber Processing. Dyeing. Spinning. Knitting. Finished Garments. INTEGRATED PRODUCTION · TECHNICAL EXPERTISE · QUALITY CONTROL. EXPLORE OUR MANUFACTURING. Our Product. Cashmere Products & Manufacturing Solutions. From premium cashmere fibers and yarns to fabrics and finished knitwear, explore our product range. 01. Cashmere Fiber. Raw Cashmere · Dehaired Cashmere · Dyed Cashmere. Explore Products →. 02. Cashmere Yarn. Worsted · Woolen · Semi-Worsted. Explore Products →. 03. Cashmere Fabric. Knitted Fabrics · Cashmere Blends. Explore Products →. 04. Cashmere Sweaters. Men’s · Women’s · Custom Knitwear. Explore Products →. 05. Cashmere Scarves & Shawls. Scarves · Shawls · Custom Designs. Explore Products →. OEM & ODM. YOUR DESIGN. OUR MANUFACTURING. Custom Cashmere Manufacturing Solutions. From material selection and yarn specifications to knitting and finished garments, we work with customers to manufacture cashmere products according to their requirements. Customization Options. Product Design: Manufacturing based on customer designs, drawings or reference samples. Material Selection: Cashmere fiber, yarn types and available blended materials. Color & Specifications: Customizable colors, yarn specifications and product requirements. Knitting & Garment Details: Different knitting structures, styles and garment specifications. DISCUSS YOUR PROJECT →. From Tech Pack to Shipment. A transparent 5-stage OEM/ODM workflow designed to guarantee precision, protect your quality standards, and keep every bulk order on schedule. 01. Tech Pack & Quotation. Provide your tech pack, CAD drawings, reference images, or a physical garment. We return a formal quotation with lead times within 24 hours. 02. Proto Sampling. We develop and dispatch your counter-sample within 7–14 days for fit verification, Pantone color approval, and hand-feel evaluation before moving to production. 03. Pre-Production Sign-Off. Once the sample is approved, we lock in yarn lots and initiate bulk knitting. Minor adjustments — whether a shade tweak or trim refit — are seamlessly absorbed without delaying the launch. 04. Bulk Knitting & In-Line QC. Standard production takes 45–60 days ( up to 75 days during peak capacity ). Real-time inline inspections run continuously on our knitting beds to eliminate defects before assembly. 05. Final Inspection & Shipping. A comprehensive AQL 2.5 final inspection is performed at 80% packing against your approved golden sample. Shipped flexibly under FOB, CIF, or DDP terms to your designated warehouse. OUR FACTORY & EQUIPMENT. A Closer Look at Our Manufacturing Facilities. Explore our production facilities, specialized equipment and manufacturing operations across the cashmere production chain. View the showroom samples or send your development brief. Review cashmere sweaters, yak and raccoon wool items, and scarves, then request a quote for your project. Request a Quote.",
     "retrieved_at": "2026-11-22T09:11:25+00:00"
