    {
     "url": "https://icubenest.com/about/",
     "page_type": "about",
     "text": "About Us – iCubeNest. Skip to content. iCubeNest. About Us. Since 2006 of full-chain knitwear manufacturing. From raw fiber dehairing to finished garment knitting, iCubeNest（Anhui Tianwei Cashmere Products Co., Ltd.） has built one continuous production practice for cashmere and fine knitwear. Every stage of manufacturing is under control — from raw fiber sourcing and spinning to final garment production — ensuring strict quality control from the very origin. Our end-to-end supply chain delivers exceptional softness, durability, and craftsmanship, making us a trusted partner for fashion brands across Europe and North America.Our work is measured by consistency, traceable materials, and disciplined craft. Anhui, China. Location. 2006. Established. Cashmere and wool products. Main business. Operating principles. Quiet discipline behind every knit. We keep our process modern, clean, and minimal because clarity serves our clients best. Each stage is planned in relation to the next, so fiber quality, machine settings, and finishing decisions stay visible from the first sample to bulk production. Our approach is grounded and trustworthy: we document how materials move through the factory, and we speak plainly about what we make and how we make it. Explore Capabilities. Material stewardship. Traceable fiber and responsible production. We maintain direct relationships with certified pastoral fiber farms, which allows us to trace raw material from source through preparation. Our sourcing focus is on transparency and documented origin, so partners know where their fiber comes from. Our factory manages dyeing effluent with attention to low-impact handling and follows international ethical labor standards across every production stage. We share these practices openly with partners reviewing our compliance and background. Industry Position. Vice President Unit of the China Wool Textile Industry Association (CWTIA). Industrial Standard Drafted: “Fox Hair Knitted Goods” (FZ/T 2024-1142T): Co-drafted by Anhui Tianwei Cashmere Products Co., Ltd., China Wool Textile Industry Association, and Beijing Wool Textile Science Research Institute Inspection Center, among other organizations. “Dehaired Fox Hair” (FZ/T 2024-1141T): Co-drafted by Tongxiang Yunsheng Textile Co., Ltd., Anhui Tianwei Cashmere Products Co., Ltd., and other industry leaders. “Raschel Knitted Fabrics” (FZ/T 24028-2021): Actively participated as a key drafting unit (jointly with Beijing Wool Textile Science Research Institute Inspection Center, Ningbo Fiber Inspection Bureau, etc.). “Wool Textile Related Standards” (FZ/T 73034-2021): Actively participated as one of the major drafting units. Global Business. International Exhibitions. Customer Factory Visits. Business Meetings. Global Cooperation.",
