     "url": "https://icubenest.com/contact/",
     "page_type": "contact",
     "text": "Contact – iCubeNest. Skip to content. iCubeNest. OEM/ODM Inquiries. Start your knitwear project. Share your tech pack, target quantities, and development timeline. Our English-speaking account managers will respond with next steps for sampling and production. Anhui Tianwei Cashmere Products Co., Ltd. Email info@icubenest.com. Phone (+86) 17791809866. (+86) 18118841122. Factory address No. 529 Jing’er Road, Fuyang Economic and Technological Development Zone, Fuyang City, Anhui Province, China. Working hours Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00 (Beijing time). Find our factory.",
