     "url": "https://icubenest.com/capabilities/",
     "page_type": "manufacturing",
     "text": "Capabilities – iCubeNest. Skip to content. iCubeNest. OUR MANUFACTURING CAPABILITIES. From Cashmere Fiber to Finished Garments. Integrated cashmere processing, spinning, dyeing, knitting and fabric manufacturing capabilities. From Cashmere Fiber to Finished Products. An integrated manufacturing process covering key stages of cashmere production. 01. Fiber Processing. Cashmere dehairing and fiber sorting. 120 automatic dehairing machines. Annual capacity: 600 tons of dehaired cashmere. 02. Dyeing. Fiber dyeing and color control. 30+ dyeing vats. Capacity range: 5–200 kg per vat. Annual capacity: 1,000 tons of dyed fiber. 03. Woolen Spinning. Woolen yarn production. 04. Worsted Spinning. Worsted and semi-worsted yarn production. 14 KYOWA 80-inch woolen spinning lines. Woolen yarn: 1,000 tons/year. Worsted and semi-worsted yarn: 500 tons/year. 05. Knitting & Garment. Computerized knitting and garment manufacturing. STOLL computerized flat knitting machines. 06. Fabric & Scarves. Fabric and scarf production. Product Manufacturing Range.",
