     "text": "Alfa Cashmere | Italian Knitting Factory. top of page. ALFA CASHMERE. Italian Knitting Factory. About us. About us. Alfa Cashmere ’s team has over 30 years of experience in the knitting field and focuses on the production of high-quality cashmere items. Alfa Cashmere exclusively uses Made in Italy yarns and all the steps involved in the production are Made in Italy, from start to finish. ​. Our mission is to bring Italian craftsmanship to the luxury knitting market all over the world by using the best existing raw material, cashmere. ​. We are located in Prato, about 30 minutes from Florence, in the heart of Tuscany. 2024-25 Collection. Find out more about our New Collection. 2024-25 FULL CATALOG COMING SOON. Our Strenghts. EXPERIENCE & COMPETENCE. Over 30 years of experience in fashion products manufacturing brought Alfa to shift its focus on the best raw material, cashmere. MADE IN ITALY PROCESS. Both the raw material used and full production are exclusively Made in Italy. COMPETITIVE PRICES. Compared to cashmere production prices found on the market. STOCK SERVICE AVAILABILITY. Alfa Cashmere also offers its cashmere stock items, ready to be shipped worldwide in just a few days from your purchase. SHORT EXECUTION TIME. All the steps are made inside the company; therefore, Alfa Cashmere can cut off production time and provide you with the fastest manufacturing and deliveries. Contact us. ALFA CASHMERE SRL. Headquarters. Via dello Sprone 9, Prato (PO), Italy. ​. Email. info@alfacashmere.com. bottom of page.",
