     "text": "Cashmere Sweater Manufacturer | Cashmere Knitwear, Cashmere Scarf. top of page. Cashmere Knitwear & Weaves. Soft & Sustainable. WATCH OUR STORY. About Us. The Grasslands of the Himalayan Mountains and the Gobi Desert, where 90% of the world Cashmere is produced, are dying at a drastic rate because of climate change. Fast fashion brands entering the industry did not help. Their business structure put an incredible pressure in Cashmere farming. ​. This has led to a dramatic decrease in quality of Cashmere. Your Cashmere is getting rougher every year, it is losing its finesse and softness. Every year, the quality of Cashmere is degrading. If You don’t do anything now then it won’t be possible for you to wear a beautiful cashmere sweater tomorrow. Learn More. What We Do? WEAVING. Industry leading weaving facility with in house dyeing, printing and sophisticated Jacquard machine line up for your next scarf. Contact Us. KNITTING. Modern knitting facility with advance computerized knitting machineries and a vigorous quality control for a perfect sweater. Contact Us. OUR YARN. Our high quality Yarn is the most Softest and probably the most ethically farmed Cashmere Yarn in the World. Learn More. Our Collection. Patasi Cashmere is a Kathmandu, Nepal-based company that manufactures cashmere knitwear, cashmere sweaters, cashmere scarves, cashmere cable-knit sweaters, cashmere ponchos, blankets, and other cashmere products. We specialize in producing high-quality cashmere items for small brands and as well as for larger brands. Our product quality is unparalleled and cannot be compared to any other cashmere product manufacturer. We manufacture a wide range of products, including scarves, blankets, sweaters, ponchos, and shawls, tailored specifically for your brand’s needs. ​. Staying up to speed with the trends of ever changing fashion industry and an increase in demand from customers we have now diversified our manufacturing unit to fashion Cashmere, Silk, Cotton and Wool products in pure as well as blended weaves and knits. with the utmost integrity and high level of business ethics. Patasi Cashmere is leading manufacturer of Cashmere Knitwear, Cashmere Sweater & Scarf. We are specialized in manufacture Cashmere Cable Knitted Sweater and a top Cashmere Knitwear Manufacturer in Kathmandu, Nepal. We manufacture Cashmere Blankets, Cashmere Scarf, Cashmere Shawls, Woven Scarves and Cashmere Poncho for Small Fashion Brands, Boutique Brands and Larger Brands. We believe that the quality of our manufacturing process will define the success of your business and the success of your business defines the success of our business. ​. Explore our Collection and Contact us to manufacture Scarfs, Blankets, Sweaters, Scarves, Poncho, Shawls for your Fashion Brands. Woven Cashmere Scarf. Cashmere Merino Unisex Scarves. Nepal Silk Cashmere Scarves. Stripe Pattern Cashmere Scarves. Light Weight Colorful Cashmere Scarves. Plain Pattern Cashmere Scarves. Blue Grey Cashmere Scarves. Grey White Strip Cashmere Merino Scarves. Light Blue Strip Cashmere Merino Scarves. Blue Grey Basket Weave Scarves. Plain Brown Cashmere Merino Scarves. Colorful Mutli Color Light Weight Scarves. Pure Hand Made Printed Cashmere Scarves. Blue Red Navy Felted Winter Scarves. Jacquard Pattern Cashmere Merino Scarves. Diamond Weave Dip Dye Cashmere Scarves. Thick Natural Brown Cashmere Scarves. Plain Embroidery Cashmere Merino Scarves. Custom Printed Woman Cashmere Scarves. Light Weight Woman Men Winter Scarves. Blog Posts. How to Choose the Right Cashmere Knitwear Manufacturer for Premium Quality and Timeless Fashion. Handmade Cashmere Shawls and Wholesale Cashmere Scarves for Global Markets. Bulk Cashmere Scarves Supplier for Premium Brands. bottom of page.",
